{"title":"Nasty Nic Salts","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNasty Juice remain one of the most popular eliquid manufacturers on the market with flavours including mint, tropical fruit, tobacco and candy blends. The bulk of the range has a 65%-70% VG ratio, perfect for sub ohm vaping whilst the 50\/50 series and Salt Nics feature a 50% VG ratio, perfect for starter kits and pod devices.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"nasty-bad-blood-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Bad Blood Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eBad Blood Salt \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"Liquid nicotine salt\"\u003eLiquid Nicotine Salt\u003c\/a\u003e: One inhale of this wonderfully unique juice and you’ll be head over heels in love! Bad Blood by Nasty Juice is an innovative blend of fresh, natural tasting, ripe blackberry with just the right balance of tart and sweet flavor and a splash of cooling mint that only adds to the authenticity of this shockingly realistic juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754484279,"sku":"Nasty Bad Blood - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754517047,"sku":"Nasty Bad Blood - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-bad-blood-nic-salt-juice-kenya.png?v=1743120648"},{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-nic-salt-lemon-mint","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Lemon Mint","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nics-salts-juices\" title=\"Nasty Juice\"\u003eNasty Juice\u003c\/a\u003e Lemon Mint from the shisha series is a bright, sourish and minty combination of clean tasting lemons and peppermint. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend this to those that like the raspberries that want to try a new shisha twist with the addition of sweet green grapes. The raspberries provide an excellent gummy pop to the texture of the clouds when inhaling. It's a fruity sensation like no other. Highly recommended.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754549815,"sku":"Nasty - Lemon Mint 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754582583,"sku":"Nasty - Lemon Mint 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-shisha-salt-lemon-mint.png?v=1743120651"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-strawberry-kiwi-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Strawberry Kiwi Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eDelight in the perfect pairing of juicy strawberries and tangy kiwi, creating a harmonious blend of sweet and tart flavors that dance on the palate with each and every puff.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41574754615351,"sku":"Nasty Liq Strawberry Kiwi 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41574754648119,"sku":"Nasty Liq Strawberry Kiwi 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Strawberry-Kiwi-min.jpg?v=1743120653"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-grape-mixed-berries","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Grape \u0026 Mixed Berries","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt Grape And Mixed Berries Nic 30ml is a grape and mix berries lover’s paradise simply by combining sugary grape soda with sticky grapetasic berries.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhen you inhale, the Nasty PODMATE Salt – GRAPE \u0026amp; MIXED BERRIES strikes the tongue right away. The berries rush across the mouth as the sweet and tangy grape flavor kills your thirst. With each exhale, you’ll feel like sugary grape \u0026amp; berries are melting on your tongue, making the sweet tooth dance with excitement.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt Grape And Mixed Berries is a seamless assortment of exotic fruits including blueberry, raspberry, grape \u0026amp; strawberry. This amazing jawbreaker will touch your jaws and heart on every vape you take.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Grape \u0026amp; Mixed Berries Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Blueberry, Raspberry, Strawberry, and Grape.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754877495,"sku":"Nasty - Grape \u0026 Mixed Berries 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754910263,"sku":"Nasty - Grape \u0026 Mixed Berries 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-grape-mixed-berries-salt.png?v=1743120674"},{"product_id":"nasty-slow-blow-nic-salt","title":"Nasty Juice Slow Blow Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSlow Blow by Nasty Salt is a savory infusion of powerful nicotine salts with elements of aromatic pineapple and tangy lime soda with added effervescence to create a beverage based fruity \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"nicotine salt juice\"\u003enicotine salt juice\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHigher dosage of nicotine making it perfect for pod open system device and for mouth to lung vaping. Nasty Salt should never be used in sub-ohm tanks or any dripper styled vape system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574754943031,"sku":"Nasty Slow Blow - 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574754975799,"sku":"Nasty Slow Blow - 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-salt-nicotine-e-juice-35mg-nasty-juice-slow-blow-blue-salt-nicotine.png?v=1743120676"},{"product_id":"nasty-asap-grape-nic-salt","title":"Nasty Juice Asap Grape Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eBurning Taste of Grape inspired from the award winning Asap Grape \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"e-juice\"\u003ee-juice\u003c\/a\u003e by Nasty.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHigher dosage of nicotine making it perfect for pod open system device and for mouth to lung vaping. Nasty Salt should never be used in sub-ohm tanks or any dripper styled vape system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574755008567,"sku":"Nasty Juice Asap Grape 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574755041335,"sku":"Nasty Juice Asap Grape 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-salt-Asap-Grape-e-juice-kenya.png?v=1743120692"},{"product_id":"nasty-mango-strawberry-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Mango Strawberry Nicotine Salt - Cush Man Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry presents us with yet another combination of everybody's top flavours, mangoes and strawberries. In the Cushman series, Nasty takes their beloved mango flavor and intertwines it with other flavors to enliven and extend your enjoyment of their classic mango flavor.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFirst off, we can clearly taste the mango flavor more than the strawberry in our 0.5ohm setup. In terms of the strawberry flavor in this blend, it tastes of strawberry candy strawberry that you find in sweets or lollies. The strawberry flavor is quite light and in the background. The yellow mango here tastes sweet, ripe and luscious. In our testing, the yellow mango flavor is very clearly identifiable with strong aroma and thick with a heavy mouthfeel. The flavor and aroma of mango hits us more than the strawberries. We would say that this blend is maybe 70% mango and 30% strawberries.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Juice Cushman Mango Strawberry is a delectable fruity \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"vape flavour\"\u003evape flavour\u003c\/a\u003e that is sure to satisfy your sweet tooth for fruity vapes. A smooth exhale leaves your tastebuds wondering which you like better, mangoes? Or strawberries? What you're certain of is that you'll need another vape to decide! \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeaturing a high level of sweetness, get this if you like sweet fruity \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/vape-liquid\" title=\"vape juices\"\u003evape juices\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574755106871,"sku":"Nasty Mango Strawberry - Cushman 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574755139639,"sku":"Nasty Mango Strawberry - Cushman 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/mango_strawberry_nasty_juice_kenya.jpg?v=1743120713"},{"product_id":"nasty-mango-banana-nicotine-salt-cushman-salt","title":"Nasty Mango Banana Nicotine Salt - Cush Man Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana presents us with yet another combination of everybody's top flavours, mangoes and bananas. In the Cushman series, Nasty takes their beloved mango flavor and intertwines it with other flavors to enliven and extend your enjoyment of their classic mango flavor.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFirst off, we can clearly taste the mango flavor more than the banana in our 0.5ohm setup. In terms of the banana flavor in this blend, it tastes of banana candy banana that you find in sweets or lollies. The banana flavor is quite light and in the background. The yellow mango here tastes sweet, ripe and luscious. In our testing, the yellow mango flavor is very clearly identifiable with strong aroma and thick with a heavy mouthfeel. The flavor and aroma of mango hits us more than the bananas. We would say that this blend is maybe 70% mango and 30% banana.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Juice Cushman Mango Banana is a delectable fruity \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"vape flavours\"\u003evape flavours\u003c\/a\u003e that is sure to satisfy your sweet tooth for fruity vapes. A smooth exhale leaves your tastebuds wondering which you like better, mangoes? Or bananas? What you're certain of is that you'll need another vape to decide! \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeaturing a high level of sweetness, get this if you like sweet fruity \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\" title=\"vape juice\"\u003evape juice\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574755434551,"sku":"Nasty Mango Banana - Cush Man 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41574755467319,"sku":"Nasty Mango Banana - Cush Man 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salt-cushman-mango-banana.jpg?v=1743120717"},{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-nic-salt-green-grape","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Green Grape","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salts\"\u003eNasty Salts\u003c\/a\u003e Green Grape is from their new Shisha Series is all about the fantastic flavor combination of crispy green seedless grapes. Now available in Salt Nic form for your pod devices.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend this for those that are bored of traditional grape flavours and would like a new grape recipe that gives the crunchy sweetness from green grapes. Be pleasantly surprised by the juiciness of this grape flavor that tastes sweet without actually containing high doses of sweetener. The airy and lightweight character of this grape juice will get surprise you. Highly recommended.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series \u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Green Grape\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41574755500087,"sku":"Nasty - Green Grape - 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35 mg","offer_id":41574755532855,"sku":"Nasty - Green Grape - 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-shisha-green-grape-salt-nic.jpg?v=1743120719"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-strawberry-kiwi","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Strawberry \u0026 Kiwi","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe ever-so-popular duo of strawberry and kiwi salt was created by Nasty podmate, Now I know what you’re thinking. There are so many other strawberry-kiwi flavors out there, too many things to choose from. Plus you may already have a go-to strawberry kiwi favorite and just looking for better deals. I can guarantee you that your search is over now that you’ve reached this page. Strawberry \u0026amp; Kiwi salt by Nasty podmate is better in two ways, the price tag and the quality in flavor. You’ll get your bargains worth and will be quick to say goodbye to the old juice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrawberry And Kiwi Nasty Podmate Salt designed this vape juice to achieve the experience most people long for when vaping on new juices. With strawberry kiwi, in just one puff you’ll get succulent strawberries on the inhale and fresh tart kiwis on the exhale, making it an extremely delicious combination that’ll at sparks in the air for your taste buds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Strawberry Kiwi Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Strawberry \u0026amp; Kiwi\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652484505655,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Strawberry \u0026 Kiwi 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652484538423,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Strawberry \u0026 Kiwi 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-strawberry-kiwi-salt.jpg?v=1746632653"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-vanilla-cuban","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Vanilla Cuban","description":"\u003cp\u003eA unique take on a Cuban tobacco classic. With notes of hand-made cigars with an earthy woody and sharp aroma with hints of sweet vanilla crème. Alongside our award-winning Nicotine Salt formula, it’s a perfect match.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Vanilla Cuban Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558233655,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Vanilla Cuban 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558266423,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Vanilla Cuban 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-vanilla-cuban-salt.jpg?v=1746638873"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-peach-lemonade","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Peach Lemonade","description":"\u003cp\u003eWith Each inhales of Nasty PODMATE Salt PEACH LEMONADE you be greeted by a tangy wave of pink lemonade. It will tickle your tongue and dazzle your taste buds with its sweet and sour flavor profile. On exhale, the sweet side of lemonade will emerge and will give you a perfect end to this tasty sensation and perfectly balance this great flavor out.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf fruity medleys excite your tongue more than anything else, this e-liquid is gonna rock your world. This blissful blend of sweet and tart goodness will rejuvenate in the best ways possible.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Peach Lemonade Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Peach \u0026amp; Lemonade\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558299191,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Peach Lemonade 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558331959,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Peach Lemonade 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-peach-lemonade-salt.jpg?v=1746638875"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-watermelon-ice","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Watermelon Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eWatermelon Ice \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salt\"\u003eNasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/a\u003e nic 30ml has the flavor profile of a watermelon fruit straw that is covered in sour sugar crystals with the kick of menthol after taste. The inhale consists of that sour taste that makes the mouth water and the taste buds jump around with excitement. Upon exhaling is when the watermelon fruit taste mixes in with the inhale and makes up the ultimate vape hit experience with icy cooling of menthol on it burst. The throat hit is extremely smooth and subtle and relaxing.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Watermelon Ice Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Watermelon \u0026amp; Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558364727,"sku":"Nasty - Watermelon Ice - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558397495,"sku":"Nasty - Watermelon Ice - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-watermelon-ice-salt.jpg?v=1746638877"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-red-energy","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Red Energy","description":"\u003cp\u003eRed Energy Nasty Podmate Salt 30ml, This exhilarating energy-flavored vape juice is as refreshing as the real deal! Its distinct and unforgettable flavor will make you want to never put down your vape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt – Red Energy, Salt Switch with Energy Juice flavor is created for true lovers of rich and pronounced taste! It is a modern disposable pod system and the best solution to get the most out of your pod experience.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Red Energy Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Energy Drink\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558430263,"sku":"Nasty Red Energy - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558463031,"sku":"Nasty Red Energy - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-red-energy-salt.jpg?v=1746638879"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-red-apple","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Red Apple","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt Red Apple Nic 30ml is their tribute to this spectacular cool apple sensation, as its also considered to be profoundly natural-tasting.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eTasting like the first bite of a fresh, fuji apple on a brisk October morning, this Nasty Podmate Salt – Red Apple delivers a bright and refreshing blend of ripe autumn apples and frosty minty flavors. A perfect choice for those who enjoy clean and crispy vapes with an icy mint exhale, Nasty Podmate Salt – Red Apple Nic Salt Juice is often praised for its smooth and well-balanced flavor which fans describe as delivering just the right amount of tartness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Red Apple Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Apple \u0026amp; Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558495799,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Red Apple 50 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558528567,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Red Apple 35 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-red-apple-salt.jpg?v=1746638882"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-menthol-tobacco","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Menthol Tobacco","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt Menthol Tobacco Juice might as well have been scraped fresh off the slopes of Menthol Mountain because it’s the pinnacle of menthol juices. Discover what makes Menthol Nic Salt Juice the peak of refreshment today and try this excellently curated nic salt formula.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWarm notes of smokiness and nuttiness remind you of your favorite blend. Then, the richness becomes increasingly noticeable, making you feel like you’re enjoying a high-end variety. Hints of sweetness tease you before some brisk splendor rounds it all out flawlessly.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Menthol Tobacco Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Tobacco \u0026amp; Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558561335,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Menthol Tobacco 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558594103,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Menthol Tobacco 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-menthol-tobacco-salt.jpg?v=1746638884"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-lychee","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Lychee","description":"\u003cp\u003eLychee Nasty Podmate Salt is the impact of sweet lychee with a hit of cool menthol that makes a blast of the fruity and chill season like you’ve never experienced.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOnce you draw in a cloud of vapor, this Asian fruity delicacy gets to work with an initial burst of subtly tart juice that wakes up your entire palate, followed by crisp and smooth notes that glide beautifully along the palate, rejuvenating you along the way\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe throat hit is complemented by a stellar mouth-to-throat encounter that isn’t brutal or oppressive. A considerable measure of times menthol and nicotine salts mean an awkward hit. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Lychee Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Lychee, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558626871,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Lychee 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558659639,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Lychee 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-lychee-salt.jpg?v=1746638886"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-mango-ice","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Mango Ice","description":"\u003cp\u003eUpon the exhale, Nasty Podmate Salt – Mango Ice will blow your taste buds away with the abundance of juicy sweetness and cooling iced menthol finish. The brilliance of a fleshy ripened mango is often described as a hybrid of menthol.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Podmate Salt – Mango Ice is bursting with frosty fruit brilliance and masterfully blended for all refillable low-wattage devices.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Mango Ice Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Mango, Menthol\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652558692407,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Mango Ice 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41652558725175,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Mango Ice 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-podmate-mango-ice-salt.jpg?v=1746638888"},{"product_id":"nasty-devil-teeth-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Honeydew Devil Teeth Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDevil Teeth\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e: Dive into the refreshing embrace of Honeydew Devil Teeth by Nasty Salt. This flavor is a masterpiece, blending the sweet, lush essence of ripe honeydew melon with a subtle, refreshing finish. Perfect for those seeking a sweet yet invigorating vaping experience, it's a delightful escape into a melon-infused paradise, making every puff an unforgettable journey.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652563542071,"sku":"Nasty Honeydew Devil Teeth 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652563574839,"sku":"Nasty Honeydew Devil Teeth 30 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salt-honeydew-devil-teeth-30ml-min.jpg?v=1746639803"},{"product_id":"nasty-juice-bronze-blend-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Bronze Blend Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eShowcasing the rich, sweet notes of the world’s best tobaccos, Bronze Blend by Nasty is a seriously delicious tobacco \u003ca title=\"nicotine e-liquid\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nic-salts\"\u003enicotine salt \u003c\/a\u003ewith sweet notes of butterscotch and caramel. You’ll love the way that the decadent butter note tickles the roof of your mouth on the exhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652563673143,"sku":"Nasty Bronze Blend 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652563705911,"sku":"Nasty Bronze Blend 30 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/bronze_blend_nasty_salt_e_juice_kenya.jpg?v=1746639823"},{"product_id":"nasty-caramel-tobacco-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Caramel Tobacco Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCaramel Tobacco\u003c\/strong\u003e: Indulge in the rich, luxurious blend of Caramel Tobacco by \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salt\"\u003eNasty Salt\u003c\/a\u003e. This flavor elegantly combines the deep, full-bodied taste of fine tobacco with the smooth, sweet notes of caramel. It's a sophisticated choice for those who appreciate the finer things in life, offering a balanced and indulgent experience. Perfect for relaxing moments, it provides a comforting warmth with every vape.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652563738679,"sku":"Nasty Caramel Tobacco 50 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652563771447,"sku":"Nasty Caramel Tobacco 35 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salt-caramel-tobacco-30ml-min.jpg?v=1746639825"},{"product_id":"nasty-almond-tobacco-gold-blend-salt","title":"Nasty Almond Tobacco Gold Blend Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eIndulge in the rich and earthy notes of Almond Tobacco (previously Gold Blend) by Nasty Juice! Blending rustic flue-cured tobacco with subtly-sweet honey and the savoury nuttiness of roasted almond; Nasty Juice's Almond Tobacco is a moreish combination of deep flavours. \u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eA smooth inhale of warm tobacco and almond floats over the taste buds, providing a flavour reminiscent of a Gold cigarette. These flavours are quickly complimented with sweet notes of syrupy honey on the exhale, perfectly rounding off this earthy blend.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLiquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFlavor: Almond Tobacco Gold Blend Salt\u003cbr\u003eFlavor Profile: Roasted almond \u0026amp; Tobacco\u003cbr\u003eNicotine Type: Nicotine Salts\u003cbr\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003cbr\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003cbr\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 35mg \/ 50mg\u003cbr\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41652564033591,"sku":"Nasty Almond Tobacco Gold Blend 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564066359,"sku":"Nasty Almond Tobacco Gold Blend 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salt-almond-tobacco-gold-30ml-min.jpg?v=1746639848"},{"product_id":"nasty-blackcurrant-lemonade-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Blackcurrant Lemonade Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eBlackcurrant Lemonade Wicked Haze Salt by Nasty e-liquid comes in a mix of blackcurrant and lemonade that creates an incredible extraordinary exhale that leaves your taste buds running wild. Enjoy Nasty's premium E-Liquid is best paired with a Pod Starter Kit.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLiquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eFlavor: Blackcurrant Lemonade Wicked Haze Salt\u003cbr\u003eFlavor Profile: Blackcurrant \/ Lemonade \/ Low Mint \/ Menthol\u003cbr\u003eNicotine Type: Nicotine Salts\u003cbr\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003cbr\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003cbr\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 35mg \/ 50mg\u003cbr\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41652564328503,"sku":"Nasty Blackcurrant Lemonade - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564361271,"sku":"Nasty Blackcurrant Lemonade - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-salt-blackcurrant-lemonade-wicked-haze-min.jpg?v=1746639874"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-fruit-fusion-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Fruit Fusion Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEmbark on a flavor adventure with a symphony of assorted fruits dancing on your palate, offering a harmonious blend of sweetness and tanginess that's as complex as it is delightful.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41652564754487,"sku":"Nasty Liq Fruit Fusion 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564787255,"sku":"Nasty Liq Fruit Fusion 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Fruit-Fusion-min.jpg?v=1746639923"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-raspberry-watermelon-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Raspberry Watermelon Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eQuench your thirst with the succulent sweetness of ripe raspberries and juicy watermelon, creating a refreshing fusion of fruity flavors that's perfect for all-day vaping.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41652564820023,"sku":"Nasty Liq Raspberry Watermelon 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41652564852791,"sku":"Nasty Liq Raspberry Watermelon 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Raspberry-Watermelon-min.jpg?v=1746639925"},{"product_id":"nasty-cushman-mango-nic-salt-juice","title":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThree layer of goodness from finest mango around the world. Cushman Mango by Nasty Salt is an exotic blend of juiced mangoes, reduced to a tasty vapable nectar that is mixed into a healthy serving of premium nicotine salts to create an \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-e-liquid\" title=\"nasty e liquid\"\u003enasty e liquid\u003c\/a\u003e that will delight the senses.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHigher dosage of nicotine making it perfect for pod open system device and for mouth to lung vaping. Nasty Salt should never be used in sub-ohm tanks or any dripper styled vape system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652567113783,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652567146551,"sku":"Nasty Juice Cushman Mango - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-kenya-cushman-mango-e-liquid.png?v=1746640073"},{"product_id":"nasty-mango-grape-nicotine-salt-cush-man-salt","title":"Nasty Mango Grape Nicotine Salt - Cush Man Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape is all mango flavors. In the Cushman series, Nasty takes their beloved mango flavor and twists it with other flavors to satisfy the vaping tongues of people that love mango!\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThe flavor of mango in this \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-e-liquid\" title=\"nicotine e juice\"\u003enicotine e juice\u003c\/a\u003e recipe tastes of familiar yellow mango. It is a ripe, sweet and luscious yellow mango flavor that is very easily identifiable. It has a strong mango aroma and tastes thick with a heavy mouthfeel. As for the grape flavor in this e juice, it is more of a candy grape flavor. We would say that the ratio of mango and grape is very balanced since you can easily feel the taste of both in every puff you take. This e juice is sweet with strong flavors that lingers in your mouth.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eIf you love juicy, ripe mangoes (we do!) and can't get enough of grape, Nasty Juice Cushman Mango Grape e juice is the one for you. Tried and tested, it is a favourite of ours here at \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/\" title=\"[YOUR BRAND]\"\u003e[YOUR BRAND]\u003c\/a\u003e! We would say that this is e juice has a high level of sweetness with a low cooling chill effect.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003ePerfect for vapers that love the flavors of mango and looking for something sweet.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50VG\/50PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41652567179319,"sku":"Nasty Mango Grape - Cush Man Salt 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41652567212087,"sku":"Nasty Mango Grape - Cush Man Salt 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/mango-grape_nasty_nic_salts.jpg?v=1746640077"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-watermelon-strawberry-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Watermelon Strawberry Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-