alt-Watermelon-Ice-min.jpg?v=1752509427"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-custard-tobacco-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Custard Tobacco Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience the epitome of sophistication with the rich creaminess of custard melding seamlessly with the robust earthiness of tobacco.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775174058039,"sku":"Nasty Liq Custard Tobacco - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775174090807,"sku":"Nasty Liq Custard Tobacco - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Custard-tobacco-min.jpg?v=1752509429"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-spearmint-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Spearmint Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRefresh your senses with the crisp coolness of spearmint, delivering a revitalizing blast of minty freshness that invigorates the palate and leaves you feeling rejuvenated.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775174156343,"sku":"Nasty Liq Spearmint - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775174189111,"sku":"Nasty Liq Spearmint - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Spearmint-min.jpg?v=1752509431"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-creamy-tobacco-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Creamy Tobacco Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience the luxurious creaminess of decadent custard intertwining with the robustness of tobacco, offering a sophisticated vape that's smooth, satisfying, and utterly indulgent.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775174221879,"sku":"Nasty Liq Creamy Tobacco - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775174254647,"sku":"Nasty Liq Creamy Tobacco - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Creamy-tobacco-min.jpg?v=1752509433"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-grape-pomegranate-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Grape Pomegranate Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Pomegranate Grape Juice is an attractive fruity flavor with a taste of purple grapes and juicy, red pomegranate seeds that invites you to enjoy and delicious vaping.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eThis juice is an exciting and unique choice for lovers of sweet and sour flavors. With every palate you will inhale the sweet taste of juicy and fresh grapes beautifully blended with the sour and sweet notes of ruby ??pomegranate seeds.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775174352951,"sku":"Nasty Liq Grape Pomegranate - 35 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775174385719,"sku":"Nasty Liq Grape Pomegranate - 50 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Salt-Grape-Pomegranate-min.jpg?v=1752509435"},{"product_id":"nasty-hippie-trail-nic-salt","title":"Nasty Juice Hippie Trail Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"row product-info\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"rte col-sm-12\" id=\"product-description\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003eHippie Trail by Nasty Salt is a tantalizing nicotine e liquid creation, blending together citrusy notes of lemon-lime coupled with effective nicotine salts to create an eJuice that is sure to captivate the senses.\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eHigher dosage of nicotine making it perfect for pod open system device and for mouth to lung vaping. Nasty Salt should never be used in sub-ohm tanks or any dripper styled vape system.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41775188901943,"sku":"Nasty Hippie Trail - 50 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41775188934711,"sku":"Nasty Hippie Trail - 30 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-e-juice-hippie-trail-flavour.png?v=1752510057"},{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-salt-grape-raspberry","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Grape Raspberry","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salt\"\u003eNasty Salt \u003c\/a\u003eGrape Raspberry is from their new Shisha Series and is all about the fantastic flavor combination of grapes and raspberries with a shisha twist. Now available in salt nicotine.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe recommend this to those that like the raspberries that want to try a new shisha twist with the addition of sweet green grapes. The raspberries provide an excellent gummy pop to the texture of the clouds when inhaling. It's a fruity sensation like no other. Highly recommended.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series Grape Raspberry\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003ePrimary Flavors: Green Grape, Raspberry\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41775188967479,"sku":"Nasty Shisha Grape Raspberry - 50 Mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41775189000247,"sku":"Nasty Shisha Grape Raspberry - 30 Mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Shisha-Salt-Grape-Raspberry.jpg?v=1752510059"},{"product_id":"nasty-shisha-nic-salt-double-apple","title":"Nasty Shisha Nic Salt - Double Apple","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salts\"\u003eNasty Salts\u003c\/a\u003e Double Apple is from their new Shisha Series and features the infamous and all time favorite flavor of double apple in salt nicotine form.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWe could be mistaken in saying that the double apple flavor here is based on the famous Al-Fakher Double Apple flavor. Or perhaps it could be from the Nakhla Double Apple flavor. Whichever it is, we think this is a good vaping replication of authentic shisha double apple with that classic mild aniseed aftertaste that's ultra clean and exotic.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhats Included:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml Nasty Shisha Salt Series\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSpecs and Features:\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50%PG \/ 50%VG, Low Mint\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ML Bottle Size\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41775189033015,"sku":"Nasty Shisha Double Apple - 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41775189065783,"sku":"Nasty Shisha Double Apple - 35 Mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Shisha-Salt-Double-Apple.jpg?v=1752510062"},{"product_id":"nasty-vanilla-tobacco-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Vanilla Tobacco Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVanilla Tobacco\u003c\/strong\u003e: Vanilla Tobacco from \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Salt\"\u003eNasty Salt\u003c\/a\u003e is a harmonious blend of classic tobacco and creamy vanilla. This flavor is a testament to simplicity and sophistication, offering a smooth, rich vaping experience. The vanilla adds a layer of sweetness and creaminess to the robust tobacco base, creating a perfectly balanced profile. Ideal for those who enjoy their vape with a touch of elegance, it's a timeless choice that soothes and satisfies.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml salt quantity\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eChoose strength level with choice- 35mg \u0026amp; 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41775189098551,"sku":"Nasty Vanilla Tobacco - 50 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"30mg","offer_id":41775189131319,"sku":"Nasty Vanilla Tobacco - 30 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salt-vanilla-tobacco-30ml-min.jpg?v=1752510064"},{"product_id":"nasty-green-apple-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Green Apple Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eGreen Apple Green Ape Salt by Nasty e-liquid comprises tart and sweet green apples, with invigorating mint for a refreshing and delightful sensation. Enjoy Nasty's premium E-Liquid is best paired with a Pod Starter Kit.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLiquid Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFlavor: Green Apple Green Ape Salt\u003cbr\u003eFlavor Profile: Apple \/ Low Mint \/ Menthol\u003cbr\u003eNicotine Type: Nicotine Salts\u003cbr\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003cbr\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003cbr\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 35mg \/ 50mg\u003cbr\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775189164087,"sku":"Nasty Green Apple - 35 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775189196855,"sku":"Nasty Green Apple - 50 Mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-salt-green-apple-green-ape-min.jpg?v=1752510066"},{"product_id":"nasty-liq-pomegranate-berry-salt","title":"Nasty Liq Pomegranate Berry Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eImmerse yourself in a whirlwind of flavor with the tangy complexity of pomegranate harmonizing with an assortment of succulent berries, offering a tantalizing vaping experience that's both refreshing and invigorating.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNasty Liq nic salts are crafted with a revolutionary new formula that delivers an explosive taste and the smoothest nicotine salt experience.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eNicotine Strength: 35mg or 50mg nic salt\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e30ml Bottle Size\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eDesigned for MTL vaping\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eTPD compliant\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775189229623,"sku":"Nasty Liq Pomegranate Berry - 35 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775189262391,"sku":"Nasty Liq Pomegranate Berry - 50 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Liq-Nicotine-Salt-Pomegranate-Berry-min.jpg?v=1752510068"},{"product_id":"nasty-grape-pomegranate-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Grape Pomegranate Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eExperience the delightful harmony of grape and pomegranate, blending the deep, luscious essence of grapes with the tangy sweetness of pomegranate. This luxurious fruit fusion is perfect for vapers desiring a sophisticated and intricate flavor profile.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e30ml Nicotine Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e50% VG \/ 50% PG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCompatible with Salt Nic Tanks, vape kits, and pod systems\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"20MG","offer_id":41775189360695,"sku":"Nasty Grape Pomegranate - 20 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41775189393463,"sku":"Nasty Grape Pomegranate - 35 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41775189426231,"sku":"Nasty Grape Pomegranate - 50 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-grape-pomegranate-min.jpg?v=1752510070"},{"product_id":"nasty-podmate-nic-salt-red-rage","title":"Nasty PodMate Nic Salt - Red Rage","description":"\u003cp\u003eRed Rage nic salt by Nasty Juice Podmate is a bubbly blend of mixed fruits and energy drink. You’ll get bold mixed fruit flavours on the inhale, followed by a fizzy energy drink profile on the exhale.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNasty Juice Podmate e-liquids are designed for low powered mouth to lung devices. Nic salts deliver a higher level of nicotine that are also more readily absorbed meaning you can keep those cravings at bay. They have the added bonus of a mild throat hit and still providing the exceptional flavour you expect from this brand.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePackage Contents Include:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1 x 30ml bottle of Red Rage Nasty Podmate Salt\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: Energy Drink\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41807769632823,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Red Rage - 50 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"35mg","offer_id":41807769665591,"sku":"Nasty PodMate - Red Rage - 35 mg","price":1600.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Nasty-Red-Rage_podmate.webp?v=1754266831"},{"product_id":"nasty-strawberry-trap-queen-nicotine-salt","title":"Nasty Strawberry Trap Queen Nicotine Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eThis nicotine vape flavour contains is a blend of ripe strawberry fruit freshly harvested from farm. You’ll be thrilled with the freshness and the sweetness that will make you feel like you’re in a strawberry farm. Give it a shot!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Salt Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Nicotine Salts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 35mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShop more nasty nicotine salts from here - \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Vape\"\u003eNasty Vape\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41807785361463,"sku":"Nasty Strawberry Trap Queen - 35 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41807785394231,"sku":"Nasty Strawberry Trap Queen - 50 mg","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-salts-strawberry-trap-queen-nic-salts.webp?v=1754267463"},{"product_id":"nasty-salts-green-mango-fatboy-salt","title":"Nasty Salts - Green Mango Fatboy Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eNasty Salts - Green Mango Fatboy salt nicotine e-liquid by Nasty Juice is a tropical fruit blend containing a fragrant, cooling edge. The sweet, ripened taste of mangos is fused with zesty lime and sharp mint for a layered flavour. \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Vape\"\u003eNasty Vape\u003c\/a\u003e Fat Boy uses salt nicotine so you'll experience a smooth throat, as well as a rapid absorption to satisfy nicotine cravings.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFat Boy salt nic e-liquid contains a 50% VG concentration, delivering rich flavour with reduced cloud production when used in a pod device or starter kit. These salts are specialising in layered fruits flavours of premium quality.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNicotine Salt Features:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Nicotine Salts\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Gorilla Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 35mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG: 50\/50\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade In Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eShop more nasty nicotine salts from here - \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/nasty-nic-salts\" title=\"Nasty Vape\"\u003eNasty Vape\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":41807804399671,"sku":"Nasty - Green Mango Fatboy - 35 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":41807804432439,"sku":"Nasty - Green Mango Fatboy - 50 mg","price":1500.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/nasty-juice-green_mango_fat_boy.webp?v=1754268250"},{"product_id":"nasty-super-cool-guava-ice-salt","title":"Nasty Super Cool - Guava Ice Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eGuava Ice Salt – Nasty Super Cool, Guava ice blends juicy ripe Guavas with a blast of icy menthol for a crisp, refreshing rush.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNASTY Juice Super Cool series is engineered frost—not just typical menthol or mint. Each flavour delivers a signature chill that enhances without muting bold, juicy top notes. Designed for full-intensity coolness. it provides a crisp, clean sensation that refreshes the palate without overpowering, ensuring flavour hits cold and clean every time..\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 35MG \u0026amp; 50MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: Nicotine Salt E-liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG Ratio: 50\/50 – Best for pod devices\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: Nasty Juice\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eOrigin: Malaysia\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nasty","offers":[{"title":"35MG","offer_id":42006259204151,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Guava Ice - 35 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false},{"title":"50MG","offer_id":42006259236919,"sku":"Nasty Super Cool - Guava Ice - 50 MG","price":1750.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0599\/6799\/5959\/files\/Guava-Ice_1024x1024_2x_6cd48230-d004-4f3b-93b1-ffc7e5acbf4f.webp?v=1764627974"},{"product_id":"nasty-super-cool-lychee-ice-salt","title":"Nasty Super Cool - Lychee Ice Salt","description":"\u003cp\u003eDive into a frosty adventure with Lychee Ice Salt – Nasty Super Cool! This 30ML vape juice bursts with the sweet floral kiss of lychee, perfectly chilled to refresh your senses.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eNASTY Juice Super Cool series is engineered frost—not just typical menthol or mint. Each flavour delivers a signature chill that enhances without muting bold, juicy top notes. Designed for full-intensity coolness. it provides a crisp, clean sensation that refreshes the palate without overpowering, ensuring flavour hits cold and clean every time..\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSalt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30ML\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Strengths: 35MG \u0026amp; 50MG\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eType: Nicotine Salt E-liquid\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eVG\/PG Ratio: 50\/50 – Best for pod devices\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\